{"props":{"pageProps":{"serie":{"serie_data":{"id":52232,"slug":"lord-god-tier-attribute-recruits-fallen-angels-of-original-sin","search_text":"lordgodtierattributerecruitsfallenangelsoforiginalsin领主：神级词条，招募原罪堕天使","status":0,"data":{"title":"Lord: God-tier Attribute, Recruits Fallen Angels of Original Sin","author":"Fu Sheng Lao Wu","description":"(The rating just came out and will rise later. It's definitely a satisfying read, not toxic or frustrating, and it has a bit of logic!)\n\n[Lord] + [Troop Type] + [Conquest] + [Multiple Women] + [Construction] + [Hoarding Rat]\n\nSu Ye transmigrated to a world where everyone is a lord, and being a lord is everything, as well as the path to godhood.\n\nStarting Awakening Talent: Supreme Ruler, First Trait: Echo of Strong Luck.\n\nEchoes of Fortune: Upgrading Lord's Heart guarantees a gold or higher-level affix.\n\nObtained terms: Super God Evolution (Red), Crystal Palace (Gold)...\n\nSuper God Evolution: Can evolve any barracks into a god-level barracks, with unit loyalty remaining constant at 100 and never decreasing.\n\nCrystal Palace: This territory can only recruit female units. Female units have a 100% increase in combat power and a potential level of +1!\n\n...........\n\nYears later, fallen angels chanted the praises of the God-Emperor, illuminating all worlds. Primordial dragons roamed the world, amidst countless stars and turrets. The God-Emperor's imperial guards arrived in the other world, opening the gates and offering warmth...\n\nCurrent Evolutionary Barracks: Chapel of Desecration → Fallen Sanctuary! Supreme Protocol!\n\nRecruiting Units: Fallen Angels of Original Sin. Genetic Forbidden Army, Pure-Blood Fallen Angels!","from_user":"73773a29-04f4-4c3c-9666-dbe8acc81559","raw":{"title":"领主：神级词条，招募原罪堕天使","author":"浮生老五","description":"（评分刚出，后续会涨的，绝对爽文，不毒，不憋屈，稍微讲点逻辑！）\n【领主】+【兵种】+【争霸】+【多女】+【建造】+【囤囤鼠】\n苏业穿越到一个全名领主的世界，在这里领主才是一切，也是成神的途径。\n开局觉醒天赋：至高主宰，第一特性：强运的回响。\n强运的回响：领主之心升级获得词条必定金色或金色以上词条。\n所获得词条：超神进化（红）水晶宫（金）.......\n超神进化：可进化任何兵营为神级兵营，兵种忠诚度恒定100，永不下降。\n水晶宫：该领地兵种只能招募雌性单位，雌性单位兵种战力增幅百分百，潜力等级+1！\n...........\n多年之后，堕天使诵念着神皇的光辉照耀诸世，始源古龙盘桓世界，亿万星辰，亿万炮塔，神皇的禁军抵达彼岸世界，开门禁军送温暖....\n目前进化兵营：亵渎教堂→堕天圣堂！ 至高协议！\n招募兵种：原罪堕天使。基因禁军，纯血堕天使！"},"image":"https://img.wtr-lab.com/cdn/series/ujGWOOGMtucuE5A8XnGYu1cBWtQClJi3k8BzzzVOh_4.jpeg"},"created_at":"2026-03-09 12:03:15.242805+00","updated_at":"2026-07-09 22:54:14.936999+00","view":2353475,"in_library":4680,"rating":3.2901785,"chapter_count":679,"power":17,"total_rate":448,"user_status":0,"verified":true,"from":"73773a29-04f4-4c3c-9666-dbe8acc81559","author":"浮生老五","view_temp":0,"raw_id":53992,"ai_enabled":true,"released_by":"65346b11-f3a8-4605-bd9f-a88bf4963a5e","raw_status":0,"raw_chapter_count":679,"char_count":1227229,"genres":[1,9,10,12,35],"raw_verified":true,"unlock_count":679,"requested_by":"73773a29-04f4-4c3c-9666-dbe8acc81559","requested_by_name":"Devil51","requested_member":"ruby","requested_role":5,"tags":[5,38,46,54,59,81,100,121,122,146,150,191,193,198,216,227,233,244,248,253,264,297,314,316,327,329,342,351,379,387,408,409,417,429,446,459,472,476,497,506,519,570,578,611,616,624,630,667,680,681,682,686,691,696,739,751,754,802,823,827],"queue_chapters":0},"ranks":{"week":"2","month":"1","all":"35"},"recommendation":[],"raws":[{"id":53992,"chapter_count":679,"view":2353477,"slug":"fanqienovel","created_at":"2026-03-09 12:03:15.242805+00","default":true,"verified":true}],"names":[{"title":"Lord: God-tier Attribute, Recruits Fallen Angels of Original Sin","raw_title":"领主：神级词条，招募原罪堕天使"}],"other_series":[{"id":19817,"slug":"honghuang-the-ancestor-of-ferocious-beasts-creating-an-immortal-imperial-clan","search_text":"honghuangtheancestorofferociousbeastscreatinganimmortalimperialclan洪荒：凶兽始祖，打造不朽帝族！","status":1,"data":{"title":"Honghuang: The Ancestor of Ferocious Beasts, Creating an Immortal Imperial Clan!","author":"Fu Sheng Lao Wu","description":"Primordial] + [Goddess] + [Taboo] + [Mastermind] + [Evil God] + [Devouring the Heavens] + [Struggle for Hegemony]\n  The universe is a shimmering expanse of heaven and earth, a primordial universe!\n  Ancient, vast, originating, boundless, limitless—this is the Primordial!\n  Here, the forbidden evil god roars, shattering billions of galaxies, while endless celestial light radiates through the ages. The\n  celestial constellations blaze with endless starlight, and boundless sacred mountains perch across the boundless earth.\n  Emperor Hao journeyed through the dawn of the Primordial World, becoming the ancestor of the Ferocious Beast Clan, the first Ferocious Beast of the Primordial World. He\n  forged an eternal plan, forging the supreme divine clan, and the glory of the Ferocious Beast Clan endures forever!\n  He is the Lord of Taboos, the ancestor of the Ferocious Beasts, and the supreme Ferocious God and Taboo. He is the greatest mastermind behind all the heavens and worlds, the creator of the Primordial...","from_user":"e9c9e5e3-9713-4a89-87f1-fb0287e61c07","raw":{"title":"洪荒：凶兽始祖，打造不朽帝族！","author":"浮生老五","description":"【洪荒】+【女神】+【禁忌】+【幕后黑手】+【凶神】+【吞噬诸天】+【争霸】\n天地玄黄，宇宙洪荒！\n古老，苍茫，起源，无垠，无限，这里就是洪荒！\n这里有禁忌凶神咆哮间亿万星河崩碎，亦有无尽的仙光璀璨照耀古往今来。\n周天星斗绽放无尽星光，无垠神山盘踞无限大地。\n帝昊穿越洪荒天地开辟之初，成为了凶兽一族始祖，洪荒天地间的第一头凶兽。\n布局万古，打造无上帝族，凶兽一族的荣光，万古长存！\n祂是禁忌之主，亦是凶兽始祖，更是无上的凶神与禁忌，诸天万界最大的幕后黑手，起源洪荒的打造者...."},"image":"https://img.wtr-lab.com/cdn/series/3Cef7QlbIibFBrvZJhkYTC61qRZq6T2zvhNWwmuvkr0.jpeg"},"created_at":"2025-08-06 08:34:11.104+00","updated_at":"2025-10-30 10:49:24.776+00","view":246411,"in_library":636,"rating":3.5416667,"chapter_count":252,"power":0,"total_rate":48,"user_status":0,"verified":true,"from":"e9c9e5e3-9713-4a89-87f1-fb0287e61c07","author":"浮生老五","view_temp":189866,"raw_id":20417}],"last_chapters":[{"serie_id":52232,"id":44082927,"order":679,"title":"Chapter 679: Mineyoshi Iwasaki!!","name":"第679章 岩崎峰礼! !","updated_at":"2026-07-09 22:54:14.918+00"},{"serie_id":52232,"id":44082926,"order":678,"title":"Chapter 678 Shuji Yamagami!!","name":"第678章 山上修二! !","updated_at":"2026-07-